 "changelog": [
  "**Agent Face** (`tc-agent-face`) – Donovan's animated face: idle, listening, thinking, speaking, happy, confused, sleeping, error and surprised, blending on springs, with floating white hands, blinks, glances and `playGesture` for a wave, nod, hop or spin. It wraps `<agent-face>` from `agent-face/`, stops drawing when off screen, and rests when it isn't busy. The shape is a placeholder until the logo artwork is available."
 ],
